        IF `a judge of that court has given a written order` THEN NOTHING   -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "may not be preferred under any of subsections (1) to (1.2) before a court without the written order of a judge of that court" [M-b]
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

